// P3.1 Kernel rebuild (intro-to-part-studios-gaps.md): extrudes go through the OpenCascade
// kernel. Sketch 1 on Top: a 50 × 30 rectangle and an R12 circle on the middle of its right side.
// Extrude 1 takes the three regions (the rectangle less the circle, the half disc inside it and
// the half disc outside): one part with a round end, its cylindrical face smooth-shaded and
// its edges crisp (01); hovering the round face outlines it (02). Sketch 2 on the part's top
// face gets a Ø10 circle, and Extrude 2 makes a boss on it (03). Deleting Sketch 2's circle
// leaves Extrude 2 with nothing to extrude (PS11.1): its row turns red, the boss is gone, the
// list header shows the error icon and still the count, "Features (6)", and the row ends in a
// red ⓘ (04); hovering the row shows why (05). Undo brings the circle back: Extrude 2 rebuilds,
// its row and the header are normal again (06). P3.2: editing Extrude 2, a depth of 0.0000001 mm
// is typed (07); the kernel itself refuses it (below its modelling tolerance). P3.3 (judge): the
// refused value is previewed and Enter doesn't accept it: the dialog stays open with the Depth
// field and the title red, the preview gone (08); hovering the row's name shows the kernel's
// reason (09). Esc cancels the edit: Extrude 2 is back (10).
// Since P3.3 Extrude 2 picks Add by itself (its boss touches Part 1): one part.
Scenario(
    start: Some("document"),
    steps: [
        WaitFor("document-shell"),
        Click(ui("sketch")),
        WaitFor("sketch-dialog"),
        ClickAt(560, 575),
        Key("N"),
        Key("G"),
        ClickWorld(0.45, 0.3),
        MoveWorld(49.12, 33.17),
        Wait(2),
        ClickWorld(49.12, 33.17),
        Type("50"),
        Key("Enter"),
        Type("30"),
        Key("Enter"),
        Key("Escape"),
        Key("C"),
        ClickWorld(50, 15),
        MoveWorld(62, 15),
        Wait(2),
        ClickWorld(62, 15),
        Key("Escape"),
        Click(ui("sketch-dialog-accept")),
        Key("Shift+7"),
        Key("Shift+E"),
        WaitFor("extrude-dialog"),
        Click(xyz(20, 15, 0)),
        Hover(xyz(45, 15, 0)),
        Wait(3),
        Click(xyz(45, 15, 0)),
        Hover(xyz(58, 15, 0)),
        Wait(3),
        Click(xyz(58, 15, 0)),
        Key("Enter"),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("01-kernel-part-with-round-end"),
        Hover(xyz(62, 15, 12)),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("02-hover-cylindrical-face"),
        Click(ui("sketch")),
        WaitFor("sketch-dialog"),
        Click(xyz(20, 15, 25)),
        Key("N"),
        Key("C"),
        ClickWorld(20, 15),
        MoveWorld(26, 15),
        Wait(2),
        ClickWorld(26, 15),
        Type("10"),
        Key("Enter"),
        Key("Escape"),
        Click(ui("sketch-dialog-accept")),
        Key("Shift+7"),
        Key("Shift+E"),
        WaitFor("extrude-dialog"),
        Click(xyz(20, 15, 25)),
        Key("Enter"),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("03-boss-extruded-on-the-top-face"),
        // PS11.1: delete the circle Extrude 2 extrudes.
        DoubleClick(ui("feature-sketch-2")),
        WaitFor("sketch-dialog"),
        ClickWorld(25, 15),
        Key("Delete"),
        Click(ui("sketch-dialog-accept")),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("04-extrude-2-failed-red"),
        Hover(ui("feature-extrude-2")),
        Wait(60),
        Screenshot("05-failed-row-tooltip"),
        // Undo brings the circle back: Extrude 2 rebuilds and its row is normal again.
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(2),
        Key("Ctrl+Z"),
        Screenshot("06-undo-extrude-2-rebuilt"),
        // The kernel refuses a depth below its modelling tolerance.
        DoubleClick(ui("feature-extrude-2")),
        WaitFor("extrude-dialog"),
        Click(ui("extrude-depth-field")),
        Key("Ctrl+A"),
        Type("0.0000001"),
        Screenshot("07-depth-below-the-kernel-tolerance-typed"),
        // Enter takes the value, but the kernel refuses it: the dialog stays open.
        Key("Enter"),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("08-refused-depth-field-red"),
        Hover(ui("feature-extrude-2")),
        Wait(60),
        Screenshot("09-row-tooltip-shows-kernel-reason"),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Key("Escape"),
        Screenshot("10-escape-cancels-the-edit"),
    ],
)
